        "encoded": "%3Cp%3EThis%20part%20introduces%20the%20queueing%20physics%20that%20underpin%20every%20latency%20SLO,%20every%20autoscaling%20policy,%20and%20every%20load%20balancer%20configuration%20in%20production.%20It%20is%20the%20mathematical%20explanation%20for%20why%20your%20system%20feels%20fine%20at%2080%25%20CPU%20and%20collapses%20at%2090%25.%3C/p%3E",
